<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="REFLECTION"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="XH"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="KYURO3"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="YUTRAZIUM"/><amll:meta key="album" value="REFLECTION"/><amll:meta key="album" value="HARDCORE UTOPIA 6"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2660148632"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2660156378"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="000cT4tS0x9IMZ"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="123163292"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="NEKOY0"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>Xanhann Yeo</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="8:46.624"><div begin="4.747" end="8:46.624"><p begin="4.747" end="5.670" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4.747" end="4.890">&quot;Can</span> <span begin="4.890" end="4.972">you</span> <span begin="4.972" end="5.111">tell</span> <span begin="5.111" end="5.232">me</span> <span begin="5.232" end="5.338">who</span> <span begin="5.338" end="5.442">am</span> <span begin="5.442" end="5.670">I?&quot;</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“你能告诉我，我是谁吗？”</span></p><p begin="55.115" end="59.276" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.115" end="55.605">I</span> <span begin="55.605" end="55.935">am</span> <span begin="55.935" end="56.602">lost</span> <span begin="56.602" end="56.940">in</span> <span begin="56.940" end="57.277">my</span> <span begin="57.277" end="58.273">tortuous</span> <span begin="58.273" end="59.276">mind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我迷失在这纷繁复杂的思绪里</span></p><p begin="59.607" end="1:05.605" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.607" end="59.943">Every</span> <span begin="59.943" end="1:00.610">voice</span> <span begin="1:00.610" end="1:00.775">in</span> <span begin="1:00.775" end="1:01.046">my</span> <span begin="1:01.046" end="1:02.268">presence</span> <span begin="1:02.268" end="1:02.771">keeps</span> <span begin="1:02.771" end="1:03.110">pushing</span> <span begin="1:03.110" end="1:03.770">me</span> <span begin="1:03.770" end="1:05.605">around</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">身边的每一个声音都肆意将我摆布</span></p><p begin="1:06.089" end="1:09.912" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.089" end="1:06.445">Still</span> <span begin="1:06.445" end="1:07.107">searching</span> <span begin="1:07.107" end="1:07.608">for</span> <span begin="1:07.608" end="1:07.940">what</span> <span begin="1:07.940" end="1:08.436">made</span> <span begin="1:08.436" end="1:08.935">me</span> <span begin="1:08.935" end="1:09.912">blind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍在寻觅，是什么让我盲目</span></p><p begin="1:10.278" end="1:15.696" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.278" end="1:10.443">But</span> <span begin="1:10.443" end="1:10.600">the</span> <span begin="1:10.600" end="1:11.522">disarray</span> <span begin="1:11.522" end="1:11.777">of</span> <span begin="1:11.777" end="1:12.605">walls</span> <span begin="1:12.605" end="1:12.937">made</span> <span begin="1:12.937" end="1:13.274">it</span> <span begin="1:13.274" end="1:13.860">nowhere</span> <span begin="1:13.860" end="1:14.107">to</span> <span begin="1:14.107" end="1:14.440">be</span> <span begin="1:14.440" end="1:15.696">found</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但杂乱的四壁让答案无处可寻</span></p><p begin="1:16.861" end="1:20.482" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.861" end="1:17.111">How</span> <span begin="1:17.111" end="1:17.606">far</span> <span begin="1:17.606" end="1:17.942">am</span> <span begin="1:17.942" end="1:18.195">I</span> <span begin="1:18.195" end="1:18.438">from</span> <span begin="1:18.438" end="1:18.611">the</span> <span begin="1:18.611" end="1:19.606">distant</span> <span begin="1:19.606" end="1:20.482">you?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我与遥远的你，究竟相隔多远？</span></p><p begin="1:20.942" end="1:26.652" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.942" end="1:21.199">Knowing</span> <span begin="1:21.199" end="1:21.779">time</span> <span begin="1:21.779" end="1:22.029">will</span> <span begin="1:22.029" end="1:22.360">stand</span> <span begin="1:22.360" end="1:23.270">still,</span> <span begin="1:23.270" end="1:23.610">do</span> <span begin="1:23.610" end="1:23.931">I</span> <span begin="1:23.931" end="1:24.192">dive</span> <span begin="1:24.192" end="1:25.085">towards</span> <span begin="1:25.085" end="1:25.703">painful</span> <span begin="1:25.703" end="1:26.652">truth?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明知时间会静止，我是否该直面痛苦的真相？</span></p><p begin="1:27.170" end="1:31.409" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.170" end="1:27.522">&quot;Face</span> <span begin="1:27.522" end="1:28.275">against</span> <span begin="1:28.275" end="1:28.603">all</span> <span begin="1:28.603" end="1:28.937">odds&quot;</span> <span begin="1:28.937" end="1:29.198">was</span> <span begin="1:29.198" end="1:29.776">said</span> <span begin="1:29.776" end="1:30.273">and</span> <span begin="1:30.273" end="1:30.940">it&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:30.940" end="1:31.409">true</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">人们总说“直面万难”，这确实没错</span></p><p begin="1:31.409" end="1:37.275" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.409" end="1:31.776">I</span> <span begin="1:31.776" end="1:31.941">can&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:31.941" end="1:32.277">find</span> <span begin="1:32.277" end="1:32.522">my</span> <span begin="1:32.522" end="1:33.111">answer</span> <span begin="1:33.111" end="1:33.440">as</span> <span begin="1:33.440" end="1:33.695">the</span> <span begin="1:33.695" end="1:34.105">road,</span> <span begin="1:34.105" end="1:34.443">I</span> <span begin="1:34.443" end="1:34.773">walk</span> <span begin="1:34.773" end="1:35.024">on</span> <span begin="1:35.274" end="1:35.771">doesn&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:35.771" end="1:36.107">lead</span> <span begin="1:36.107" end="1:36.357">me</span> <span begin="1:36.357" end="1:36.940">to</span> <span begin="1:36.940" end="1:37.275">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可我找不到答案，我走的路并未通向你</span></p><p begin="1:37.275" end="1:44.658" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:37.275" end="1:38.608">I</span> <span begin="1:38.608" end="1:39.108">watch</span> <span begin="1:39.108" end="1:39.605">me</span> <span begin="1:39.605" end="1:40.849">fall</span> <span begin="1:41.271" end="1:41.778">with</span> <span begin="1:41.778" end="1:42.194">my</span> <span begin="1:42.194" end="1:44.658">thoughts</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">凝视自我，连同思绪也一同坠落</span></p><p begin="1:44.898" end="1:47.938" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:44.898" end="1:45.057">To</span> <span begin="1:45.057" end="1:45.270">go</span> <span begin="1:45.270" end="1:45.528">left</span> <span begin="1:45.528" end="1:45.770">or</span> <span begin="1:45.770" end="1:45.936">right,</span> <span begin="1:45.936" end="1:46.021">I</span> <span begin="1:46.021" end="1:46.441">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:46.441" end="1:46.774">know</span> <span begin="1:46.774" end="1:47.107">where</span> <span begin="1:47.107" end="1:47.274">to</span> <span begin="1:47.274" end="1:47.605">find</span> <span begin="1:47.605" end="1:47.938">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">彷徨无措，不知该去哪里寻找你</span></p><p begin="1:47.938" end="1:55.327" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:47.938" end="1:49.275">My</span> <span begin="1:49.275" end="1:50.273">vision&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:50.273" end="1:50.939">blurred</span> <span begin="1:50.939" end="1:51.274">and</span> <span begin="1:51.274" end="1:51.605">fate</span> <span begin="1:51.605" end="1:51.771">will</span> <span begin="1:51.771" end="1:52.440">forever</span> <span begin="1:52.440" end="1:52.853">be</span> <span begin="1:52.853" end="1:55.327">unsought</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">视线模糊，命运也永远无人探寻</span></p><p begin="1:55.442" end="1:58.522" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:55.442" end="1:55.541">The</span> <span begin="1:55.541" end="1:55.684">day</span> <span begin="1:55.684" end="1:55.774">that</span> <span begin="1:55.774" end="1:55.863">I</span> <span begin="1:55.863" end="1:56.274">find</span> <span begin="1:56.274" end="1:56.522">my</span> <span begin="1:56.522" end="1:56.689">real</span> <span begin="1:56.689" end="1:57.029">self</span> <span begin="1:57.029" end="1:57.523">won&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:57.523" end="1:57.941">ever</span> <span begin="1:57.941" end="1:58.194">be</span> <span begin="1:58.194" end="1:58.522">true</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">找到真我的那天，似乎永远不会来临</span></p><p begin="1:58.603" end="2:07.940" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:58.603" end="1:59.268">I</span> <span begin="1:59.268" end="2:00.609">deny</span> <span begin="2:00.609" end="2:01.106">what</span> <span begin="2:01.106" end="2:01.438">I</span> <span begin="2:01.438" end="2:02.538">see</span> <span begin="2:02.538" end="2:02.943">right</span> <span begin="2:02.943" end="2:03.032">in</span> <span begin="2:03.032" end="2:03.438">front</span> <span begin="2:03.438" end="2:03.772">of</span> <span begin="2:03.772" end="2:07.940">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我否认着眼前所见</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="2:04.607" end="2:08.698"><span begin="2:04.607" end="2:04.940">(Is</span> <span begin="2:04.940" end="2:05.271">there</span> <span begin="2:05.271" end="2:06.272">light?</span> <span begin="2:06.272" end="2:06.775">Or</span> <span begin="2:06.775" end="2:07.111">is</span> <span begin="2:07.111" end="2:07.446">there</span> <span begin="2:07.446" end="2:08.698">hope?)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还有光吗？还有希望吗？</span></span></p><p begin="2:09.198" end="2:17.218" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:09.198" end="2:09.940">Can</span> <span begin="2:09.940" end="2:10.613">you</span> <span begin="2:10.613" end="2:11.277">bring</span> <span begin="2:11.277" end="2:11.537">me</span> <span begin="2:11.537" end="2:12.278">home</span> <span begin="2:12.278" end="2:13.275">and</span> <span begin="2:13.275" end="2:13.601">can</span> <span begin="2:13.601" end="2:13.771">you</span> <span begin="2:13.771" end="2:14.107">set</span> <span begin="2:14.107" end="2:14.441">me</span> <span begin="2:14.441" end="2:17.218">free?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你能带我回家，还我自由吗？</span></p><p begin="3:03.276" end="3:07.307" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:03.276" end="3:03.607">I</span> <span begin="3:03.607" end="3:03.939">am</span> <span begin="3:03.939" end="3:04.670">lost</span> <span begin="3:04.670" end="3:04.937">in</span> <span begin="3:04.937" end="3:05.215">my</span> <span begin="3:05.215" end="3:06.276">tortuous</span> <span begin="3:06.276" end="3:07.307">mind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我迷失在这纷繁复杂的思绪里</span></p><p begin="3:07.605" end="3:13.308" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:07.605" end="3:07.936">Every</span> <span begin="3:07.936" end="3:08.440">noise</span> <span begin="3:08.440" end="3:09.041">coming</span> <span begin="3:09.041" end="3:09.277">from</span> <span begin="3:09.277" end="3:09.571">all</span> <span begin="3:09.571" end="3:10.442">directions</span> <span begin="3:10.442" end="3:10.608">is</span> <span begin="3:10.608" end="3:10.937">driving</span> <span begin="3:10.937" end="3:11.438">me</span> <span begin="3:11.438" end="3:13.308">insane</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">四面八方传来的喧嚣，让我几近疯狂</span></p><p begin="3:13.610" end="3:19.775" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:13.610" end="3:13.896">And</span> <span begin="3:13.896" end="3:14.276">all</span> <span begin="3:14.276" end="3:14.606">my</span> <span begin="3:14.606" end="3:15.385">life</span> <span begin="3:15.385" end="3:15.611">I&apos;ve</span> <span begin="3:15.611" end="3:15.798">been</span> <span begin="3:15.798" end="3:16.468">swimming</span> <span begin="3:16.468" end="3:17.113">through</span> <span begin="3:17.113" end="3:17.275">a</span> <span begin="3:17.275" end="3:17.524">sea</span> <span begin="3:17.524" end="3:17.605">of</span> <span begin="3:17.605" end="3:19.775">uncertainty</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一生都在茫茫未定之海中沉浮</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="3:19.442" end="3:20.862"><span begin="3:19.442" end="3:19.607">(I</span> <span begin="3:19.607" end="3:19.852">think</span> <span begin="3:19.852" end="3:19.941">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="3:19.941" end="3:20.270">running</span> <span begin="3:20.270" end="3:20.439">out</span> <span begin="3:20.439" end="3:20.602">of</span> <span begin="3:20.602" end="3:20.862">breath)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想我已快喘不过气</span></span></p><p begin="3:20.774" end="3:23.941" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="3:20.774" end="3:20.936">The</span> <span begin="3:20.936" end="3:21.102">end</span> <span begin="3:21.102" end="3:21.274">keeps</span> <span begin="3:21.274" end="3:21.602">running</span> <span begin="3:21.602" end="3:22.109">away,</span> <span begin="3:22.109" end="3:22.442">pulling</span> <span begin="3:22.442" end="3:22.609">me</span> <span begin="3:22.609" end="3:22.937">closer</span> <span begin="3:22.937" end="3:23.101">to</span> <span begin="3:23.101" end="3:23.941">death</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终点不停逃离，将我拽向死亡边缘</span></p><p begin="3:23.942" end="3:31.106" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:23.942" end="3:25.103">I</span> <span begin="3:25.103" end="3:25.769">found</span> <span begin="3:25.769" end="3:27.103">myself</span> <span begin="3:27.103" end="3:27.943">staring</span> <span begin="3:27.943" end="3:28.445">at</span> <span begin="3:28.445" end="3:28.774">the</span> <span begin="3:28.774" end="3:31.106">sky</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我发觉自己正凝视着天空</span></p><p begin="3:31.378" end="3:34.601" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:31.378" end="3:31.777">Hoping</span> <span begin="3:31.777" end="3:31.945">to</span> <span begin="3:31.945" end="3:32.272">god</span> <span begin="3:32.272" end="3:32.442">that</span> <span begin="3:32.442" end="3:32.519">a</span> <span begin="3:32.519" end="3:32.775">star</span> <span begin="3:32.775" end="3:33.113">can</span> <span begin="3:33.113" end="3:33.439">appear</span> <span begin="3:33.439" end="3:33.851">somewhere</span> <span begin="3:33.851" end="3:34.275">up</span> <span begin="3:34.275" end="3:34.601">high</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向上帝祈愿，有颗星星能在天际出现</span></p><p begin="3:34.603" end="3:43.772" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:34.603" end="3:35.940">Blinding</span> <span begin="3:35.940" end="3:36.369">eyes</span> <span begin="3:36.369" end="3:36.854">as</span> <span begin="3:36.854" end="3:37.270">it</span> <span begin="3:37.270" end="3:37.943">flies</span> <span begin="3:37.943" end="3:38.277">at</span> <span begin="3:38.277" end="3:38.606">the</span> <span begin="3:38.606" end="3:39.104">speed</span> <span begin="3:39.104" end="3:39.608">of</span> <span begin="3:39.608" end="3:43.772">light</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">它以光速飞过，光芒刺痛着我的双眼</span></p><p begin="3:42.110" end="3:45.170" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:42.110" end="3:42.278">I</span> <span begin="3:42.278" end="3:42.443">might</span> <span begin="3:42.443" end="3:42.603">be</span> <span begin="3:42.603" end="3:42.937">pushing</span> <span begin="3:42.937" end="3:43.109">too</span> <span begin="3:43.109" end="3:43.440">much</span> <span begin="3:43.440" end="3:43.610">till</span> <span begin="3:43.610" end="3:43.775">I</span> <span begin="3:43.775" end="3:44.111">can&apos;t</span> <span begin="3:44.111" end="3:44.268">catch</span> <span begin="3:44.268" end="3:44.441">it</span> <span begin="3:44.441" end="3:45.170">right</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或许我太过强求，却始终无法抓住它</span></p><p begin="4:06.881" end="4:09.220" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="4:06.881" end="4:07.297">Keep</span> <span begin="4:07.297" end="4:07.633">going,</span> <span begin="4:07.633" end="4:08.088">stop</span> <span begin="4:08.088" end="4:08.380">breaking</span> <span begin="4:08.380" end="4:08.550">till</span> <span begin="4:08.550" end="4:09.220">sundown</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">坚持向前，别再崩溃，直到日落西山</span></p><p begin="4:09.379" end="4:11.854" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="4:09.379" end="4:09.799">Finish</span> <span begin="4:09.799" end="4:09.962">the</span> <span begin="4:09.962" end="4:10.215">puzzle</span> <span begin="4:10.215" end="4:10.421">and</span> <span begin="4:10.421" end="4:10.714">fear</span> <span begin="4:10.714" end="4:11.133">shall</span> <span begin="4:11.133" end="4:11.298">be</span> <span begin="4:11.298" end="4:11.632">ran</span> <span begin="4:11.632" end="4:11.854">down</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拼好拼图，恐惧便会消散</span></p><p begin="4:12.211" end="4:14.598" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="4:12.211" end="4:12.597">Keep</span> <span begin="4:12.597" end="4:12.965">going,</span> <span begin="4:12.965" end="4:13.463">stop</span> <span begin="4:13.463" end="4:13.754">breaking</span> <span begin="4:13.754" end="4:13.880">till</span> <span begin="4:13.880" end="4:14.598">sundown</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">坚持向前，别再崩溃，直到日落西山</span></p><p begin="4:14.716" end="4:17.296" itunes:key="L27"